   <Row>
    <Cell ss:MergeAcross="11" ss:StyleID="MethodRow"><Data ss:Type="String">GetAllRuleDetailsAsync, PlatformPolicyService, YOLO26 Two-Stage &amp; 10 Categories (v2.7.0)</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="78">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC015</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Tạo danh mục &quot;pvc_pipe&quot; qua CreateWasteCategoryAsync (tự sinh SortingRule DRAFT) và thêm thẳng danh mục cũ &quot;used_oil&quot; vào DB chưa có SortingRule</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GetAllRuleDetailsAsync(includeDraft: true) &amp; GetAllRuleDetailsAsync(includeDraft: false)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">includeDraft=true trả cả 2: pvcRule (RuleId != Empty, Status = &quot;DRAFT&quot;) và legacyRule (RuleId = Empty, Status = &quot;DRAFT&quot;, CategoryCode = &quot;used_oil&quot;); includeDraft=false loại bỏ cả 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">2026-11-23</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Hoàng Thắng Nguyễn</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Passed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Pending</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">N/A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Hỗ trợ hiển thị cả danh mục cũ chưa có SortingRule trong Rule Engine</Data></Cell>
   </Row>
   <Row ss:Height="92">
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">UTC016</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">InMemory DB sạch với PlatformPolicyService &amp; AuditLogService (adminId)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">GetPublicPoliciesAsync(&quot;PRIVACY&quot;), CreatePolicyAsync(&quot;TERMS&quot;, ...), CreatePolicyAsync(Code=&quot;TERM-04&quot;) trùng mã, UpdatePolicyAsync(..., Status=&quot;DRAFT&quot;), ẩn/xóa mục ACTIVE cuối cùng, DeletePolicyAsync(DRAFT)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCell"><Data ss:Type="String">Tự seed 5 mục mặc định; lọc PRIVACY trả &quot;PRIV-01&quot;; tạo mới tự sinh &quot;TERM-04&quot;; trùng mã ném ConflictException(&quot;BR-POL-02&quot;); ẩn/xóa mục ACTIVE cuối cùng ném BusinessRuleException(&quot;BR-POL-03&quot;); xóa DRAFT thành công &amp; ghi AuditLog CREATE/DELETE_PLATFORM_POLICY</Data></Cell>
    <Cell ss:StyleID="DataCellCenter"><Data ss:Type="String">Normal</Data></Cell>
